\/gap>. \u2018They look healthy,\u2019 she said.<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Then she said, \u2018Take off your glasses so I can look at your <sup>3<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_2\"><\/gap>.\u2019 She checked them and then said, \u2018No problems there! Now open your <sup>4<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_3\"><\/gap> and say \u2018aaaaah\u2019.\u2019 Again, she seemed happy. After that, she looked in my <sup>5<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_4\"><\/gap>. \u2018Can you smell things OK? Any problems there?\u2019 she asked. I said no. Finally, she said, \u2018Lie on your <sup>6<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_5\"><\/gap> on the table, looking up.\u2019 She pressed her fingers on my <sup>7<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_6\"><\/gap>. \u2018Any problems here?\u2019 she asked.<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">I wanted to laugh! \u2018No,\u2019 I said. \u2018No problems!\u2019 \u2018You\u2019re healthy!\u2019 she said.<\/p>"],"globalTypesConfigs":[{"type":"gap","widthMode":"asLongestWord","longestAlternativeSolutions":false,"ignoreCaseSensitivity":false}]}]}